From 56e0237ecdca9b37fdca828a3ff18f04da8f2206 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:51:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 22/30] test: declare the rpc, wallet and tool tests'
 parameters as class attributes

Applies contrib/devtools/declarative-test-params.py to the rpc_*,
wallet_* and tool_* tests and example_test.py: 71 of 73 converted.
example_test.py and wallet_assumeutxo.py compute parameters and keep
set_test_params().

Ten tests still use set_test_params(), each for parameters computed at
runtime. Every converted module imports, and the full functional suite
gives the same per-test results as before.
